final_output:  ["007,995.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **611** and **966**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n611 \\times 966 &= 611 \\times (900 + 60 + 6) \\\\\n&= 611 \\times 900 + 611 \\times 60 + 611 \\times 6 \\\\\n&= 549,\\!900 + 36,\\!660 + 3,\\!666 \\\\\n&= 549,\\!900 + 36,\\!660 \\\\\n&= 586,\\!560 \\\\\n&= 586,\\!560 + 3,\\!666 \\\\\n&= 590,\\!226\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{590,\\!226}\n\\]", '']
