final_output:  ['237,380.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **599** and **350**, follow these easy steps:\n\n### Step 1: Break Down the Multiplication\nUse the distributive property to simplify the multiplication:\n\n\\[\n599 \\times 350 = 599 \\times (300 + 50) = 599 \\times 300 + 599 \\times 50\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply by 300\n\\[\n599 \\times 300 = 179,\\!700\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Multiply by 50\n\\[\n599 \\times 50 = 29,\\!950\n\\]\n\n### Step 4: Add the Results\n\\[\n179,\\!700 + 29,\\!950 = 209,\\!650\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{209,\\!650}\n\\]', '']
