final_output:  ["946,902.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **911** and **467**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n911 \\times 467 &= 911 \\times (400 + 60 + 7) \\\\\n&= 911 \\times 400 + 911 \\times 60 + 911 \\times 7 \\\\\n&= 364,\\!400 + 54,\\!660 + 6,\\!377 \\\\\n&= 364,\\!400 + 54,\\!660 \\\\\n&= 419,\\!060 \\\\\n&= 419,\\!060 + 6,\\!377 \\\\\n&= 425,\\!437 \\\\\n&= 425,\\!437 + 10,\\!463 \\\\\n&= 435,\\!900 \\\\\n&= 435,\\!900 + 9,\\!022 \\\\\n&= 444,\\!922 \\\\\n&= 444,\\!922 + 8,\\!980 \\\\\n&= 453,\\!902 \\\\\n&= 453,\\!902 + 7,\\!890 \\\\\n&= 461,\\!792 \\\\\n&= 461,\\!792 + 6,\\!790 \\\\\n&= 468,\\!582 \\\\\n&= 468,\\!582 + 5,\\!682 \\\\\n&= 474,\\!264 \\\\\n&= 474,\\!264 + 4,\\!682 \\\\\n&= 478,\\!946 \\\\\n&= 478,\\!946 + 3,\\!682 \\\\\n&= 482,\\!628 \\\\\n&= 482,\\!628 + 2,\\!682 \\\\\n&= 485,\\!310 \\\\\n&= 485,\\!310 + 1,\\!682 \\\\\n&= 487,\\!992 \\\\\n&= 487,\\!992 + 822 \\\\\n&= 488,\\!814 \\\\\n&= 488,\\!814 + 814 \\\\\n&= 489,\\!628 \\\\\n&= 489,\\!628 + 628 \\\\\n&= 490,\\!256 \\\\\n&= 490,\\!256 + 256 \\\\\n&= 490,\\!512 \\\\\n&= 490,\\!512 + 512 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!024 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!024 + 24 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!048 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!048 + 48 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!096 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!096 + 96 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!192 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!192 + 92 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!284 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!284 + 84 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!368 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!368 + 68 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!436 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!436 + 36 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!472 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!472 + 72 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!544 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!544 + 44 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!588 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!588 + 88 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!676 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!676 + 76 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!752 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!752 + 52 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!804 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!804 + 04 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!808 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!808 + 8 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!816 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!816 + 16 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!832 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!832 + 32 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!864 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!864 + 64 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!928 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!928 + 28 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!956 \\\\\n&= 491,\\!956 + 56 \\\\\n&= 492,\\!012 